{
    "background_story": "Neriah was a renowned spa owner who believed in the art of pampering. Growing up in a family of healers, she learned the secrets of relaxation and rejuvenation from a young age. Her spa, 'Serenity Oasis', was a haven for those seeking to escape the stresses of modern life. Neriah took great pride in crafting personalized treatments, from soothing massages to nourishing facials. Her attention to detail and genuine care for her clients' well-being earned her a loyal following among the city's elite. Neriah's own self-care rituals were just as indulgent, often spending hours in her private garden, surrounded by calming scents and soothing sounds. Her mantra was simple: 'Pamper yourself, and the world will pamper you back'. And indeed, Neriah's life was a testament to the transformative power of self-love and indulgence.",
